<title>USA: Pacific Sunwear sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Pacific Sunwear sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Sunwear of California Inc said on Friday it had declared a three-for-two stock split, payable October 18, record October 9.</p>
<p>Pacific Sunwear said cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>The company said it has 5,367,326 shares outstanding.</p>
